Install BusyBox and essential system libraries

1. Download and set up static BusyBox binary:

`curl -L -o $KLFS/bin/busybox https://busybox.net/downloads/binaries/1.35.0-x86_64-linux-musl/busybox`
`chmod +x $KLFS/bin/busybox`

2. Populate core symlinks from BusyBox:

`cd $KLFS/bin`
`./busybox --install -s .`

3. Copy essential glibc runtime libraries from host Gentoo system:

`cp -av /lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2 $KLFS/lib64/`
`cp -av /lib64/libc.so.6 $KLFS/lib64/`
`cp -av /lib64/libm.so.6 $KLFS/lib64/`
`cp -av /lib64/libresolv.so.2 $KLFS/lib64/`
